November 24, 1993 (Volume 40, Issue 14) pg. A16). There is also
extensive case law on student newspapers, campus (paper) mail systems,
and (traditonal) bulletin boards that like the enclosed case is based
on principles general enough to cover a campus' Netnews servers.

