Unfortunately, I really think this would be the "thin end of the wedge". I, 
personally, am not TOTALLY opposed to the over-18 criteria for graphically 
"violent" cards/games. 
But, when you get right down to it, an adult should 
have the right to buy, sell, and otherwise "enjoy" any and all matter of 
"objectionable" material,. as long as no laws were violated in its production 
